I have heard of the orcs you saw in the tomb before... this is not good news.

If they seek the key to Auchindoun, we must stop them from obtaining the remaining key fragments. Nyami was right; the fragments are no longer safe where they lay.

There's no time to waste. We will ride together to the Tomb of Lights and secure them ourselves. 
